 Playerbots.ValithriaPortals = 1
 
+# Icecrown Citadel, Valithria Dreamwalker: her adds. The first tank holds the abominations and faces their Gut
+# Spray away from the raid; the second holds the archmages, skeletons and blistering zombies; both share the rot
+# worms. Damage dealers kill a skeleton first, then a zombie, the worms, the suppressers, the archmages and a lone
+# abomination last (with two up, one goes right after the worms), with worms and suppressers marked where the most
+# stand; any bot with an interrupt stops a Frostbolt Volley; a tank under her adds uses its own defensive
+# cooldowns. 0 restores the ValithriaHealerFocus behaviour exactly. Default: 1.
+Playerbots.ValithriaAdds = 1
+
+# With ValithriaPortals: the healers on her take the portals in turn. At most one healer is in the dream or on the
+# way to a portal at a time, never so many that fewer than one (two with four or more healers) stay on her, and the
+# turn goes to the healer with the fewest trips. 0 sends every healer on her through each portal wave together, as
+# before. Default: 1.
+Playerbots.ValithriaPortalTurns = 1
+
 # Opt-in Malygos drake positioning/rotation and human-led Flame Leviathan vehicles.
 # Uses normal boarding and spell costs; never moves the human or skips a boss.
