+// Portal turns (Playerbots.ValithriaPortalTurns). Live on 2026-11-26 both healers on her took every portal wave
+// together, leaving none or one healing her for 20-25 s a cycle while she stalled. At most one healer is in the
+// dream or on the way to a portal at a time, and never so many that fewer than PortalFloor stay on her; the turn
+// goes to the free healer with the fewest trips, then the one whose last trip is oldest, then the lowest guid,
+// so trips alternate.
+struct PortalTaker
+{
+    std::uint64_t guid = 0;
+    std::uint32_t trips = 0;
+    std::uint32_t sinceLastMs = 0;  // since its last trip; the largest value when it has none
+    bool busy = false;              // in the dream, or holding a live portal claim
